@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Rotate with input in progress
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Parent" as actor
box "Frontend — Seedlings PWA" #E0F2FE
  participant "Browser layout engine" as browser
  participant "Intake step page" as page
  participant "sl-text-field (input element)" as field
  participant "App (app-root)" as shell
end box
actor -> field : Type a value; focus stays in the field
actor -> browser : Rotate portrait to landscape
browser -> browser : Viewport 390 x 844 becomes 844 x 390
browser -> shell : Re-evaluate media queries only
shell -> shell : CSS switches bottom nav to top bar; no component created or destroyed
browser -> page : Reflow .flow layout
page -> field : Same element instance, same value, same focus
field --> actor : Input intact after reflow (L2-004 criterion 5)
actor -> browser : Rotate back to portrait
browser -> page : Reflow again
page --> actor : Value and focus still intact
@enduml
